        "lines": [
          "Psalm 130"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Hope in the Lord’s Forgiving Love."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Song of Ascents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Out of the depths I have cried to You, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, hear my voice!",
          "Let Your ears be attentive",
          "To the sound of my pleadings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If You, Lord, were to keep account of guilty deeds,",
          "Lord, who could stand?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But there is forgiveness with You,",
          "So that You may be revered."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶I wait for the Lord, my soul waits,",
          "And I wait for His word."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My soul waits in hope for the Lord",
          "More than the watchmen for the morning;",
          "Yes, more than the watchmen for the morning."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Israel, wait for the Lord;",
          "For with the Lord there is mercy,",
          "And with Him is abundant redemption."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And He will redeem Israel",
          "From all his guilty deeds."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
